# Planning / Gantt

See [.github/copilot-instructions.md](../../.github/copilot-instructions.md) § Resource Planning.

- Render bars by `TaskAllocationHeaderId` (one bar per header slice), not naive date-gap grouping.
- Normal drag: move full slice; Ctrl+drag: partial slice by **hours**.
- New allocations must set `TaskAllocationHeaderId` on TaskAllocations and TaskChildAllocations.
- Availability: user day capacity minus TaskAllocations **and** TaskChildAllocations for that date.
- Prefer date-scoped API queries for initial load (`startDate`/`endDate` on allocations); avoid N+1 per project/user/parent when a bulk or parallel fetch is possible.
- `app/planning/page.tsx` is large — prefer extracting hooks/components over growing the monolith.
